    <span class="hero-ornament"></span>
    <h1 class="research-title">History games</h1>
    <p class="ref-lede">Three quick games built from the collection itself. No sign-up, nothing to install; your best scores stay in this browser. For a daily challenge, try the <a href="/quiz">History Quiz</a> too.</p>
