      <p class="gm-howto">Find the matching pairs of emblems. Fewer flips, more stars.</p>
      <p class="gm-score"><span id="pairs-moves">0 flips</span><span class="gm-best" id="pairs-best"></span></p>
      <button type="button" class="gm-again" id="pairs-new">New round ↻</button>
    </div>
    <div class="gm-pairs" id="pairs-grid"></div>
